@Library_Book_Lending_HostAddress = http://localhost:5241

### Login (copy the token from the response)
POST {{Library_Book_Lending_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "librarian@library.com",
  "password": "Library123!"
}

### List books (replace YOUR_TOKEN with the token from the login response)
GET {{Library_Book_Lending_HostAddress}}/api/Books
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### Anonymous call: should return 401
GET {{Library_Book_Lending_HostAddress}}/api/Users